==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] to quickly take down Nobunaga. If you have collected every [[treasure]] from [[Empire of Cats]], this level should be a breeze.

==Trivia==
*Since it contains [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]], Despot's Ambition may be a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Nobunaga's Ambition|Nobunaga's Ambition]]'' series of games.

